  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "집에 두고 왔나...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9D1C5D00020B450ACE00020C654B098002E002E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨,\n잠시 부탁드리고 싶은 것이...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020C528002C000AC7A0C2DC0020BD80D0C1B4DCB9ACACE00020C2F6C7400020AC83C774002E002E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...아니에요, 괜찮아요.\n안샤 씨와 이야기해 볼게요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002EC544B2C8C5D0C694002C0020AD1CCC2EC544C694002E000AC548C0E40020C528C6400020C774C57CAE30D5740020BCFCAC8CC694002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "안샤 씨,\n후파의 힘을 빌리고 싶은 일이 있는데요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C548C0E40020C528002C000AD6C4D30CC7580020D798C7440020BE4CB9ACACE00020C2F6C7400020C77CC7740020C788B294B370C694002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "안 돼요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5480020B3FCC694002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "후파에게 두고 온 물건을 가져오게 하는 건\n반칙이니까 안 돼요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D6C4D30CC5D0AC8C0020B450ACE00020C6280020BB3CAC74C7440020AC00C838C624AC8C0020D558B2940020AC74000ABC18CE59C774B2C8AE4C0020C5480020B3FCC694002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럴 수가...\n안샤 씨는 잘만...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F40020C218AC00002E002E002E000AC548C0E40020C528B2940020C798B9CC002E002E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 후파의 힘을 빌려서 호텔을 오가는 건\n불필요한 걱정을 끼치지 않기 위해서예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC000020D6C4D30CC7580020D798C7440020BE4CB824C11C0020D638D154C7440020C624AC00B2940020AC74000ABD88D544C694D55C0020AC71C815C7440020B07CCE58C9C00020C54AAE300020C704D574C11CC608C694002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어머니께서도\n게으른 건 나쁘다고 말씀하셨어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4BA38B2C8AED8C11CB3C4000AAC8CC73CB9780020AC740020B098C058B2E4ACE00020B9D0C500D558C168C5B4C694002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "확실히 제가 멤버분들에게\n너무 기대고 있었던 것 같기도 하네요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D655C2E4D7880020C81CAC000020BA64BC84BD84B4E4C5D0AC8C000AB108BB340020AE30B300ACE00020C788C5C8B3580020AC830020AC19AE30B3C40020D558B124C694002E002E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "알겠어요!\n제 일은 제 스스로 해결할게요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C54CACA0C5B4C6940021000AC81C0020C77CC7400020C81C0020C2A4C2A4B85C0020D574ACB0D560AC8CC6940021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨! 기합을 불어넣을 수 있게\n저와 진검승부를 겨뤄 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020C52800210020AE30D569C7440020BD88C5B4B123C7440020C2180020C788AC8C000AC800C6400020C9C4AC80C2B9BD80B97C0020ACA8B9040020C8FCC138C694002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 밖에서 기다리고 있을게요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020BC16C5D0C11C0020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788C744AC8CC694002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저희도 같이\n이노 씨의 진심을 다한 모습을 지켜볼게요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800D76CB3C40020AC19C774000AC774B1780020C528C7580020C9C4C2ECC7440020B2E4D55C0020BAA8C2B5C7440020C9C0CF1CBCFCAC8CC694002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "삐햐햐!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C090D590D59000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨,\n저와 진검승부를 겨뤄 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020C528002C000AC800C6400020C9C4AC80C2B9BD80B97C0020ACA8B9040020C8FCC138C6940021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC54400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠깐만",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0AE50B9CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승패를 떠나, 제가 얼마나\n진심을 다할 수 있는지 시험해 보겠어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9D328B97C0020B5A0B098002C0020C81CAC000020C5BCB9C8B098000AC9C4C2ECC7440020B2E4D5600020C2180020C788B294C9C00020C2DCD5D8D5740020BCF4ACA0C5B4C694002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르 최강의 트레이너를 상대로\n어디까지 해낼 수 있는지...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n저 자신을 시험해 보겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B9740020CD5CAC15C7580020D2B8B808C774B108B97C0020C0C1B300B85C000AC5B4B514AE4CC9C00020D574B0BC0020C2180020C788B294C9C0002E002E002E00100001BE00000AC8000020C790C2E0C7440020C2DCD5D8D5740020BCF4ACA0C5B4C6940021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "곤율거니 씨가 얼마나 강한지\n직접 보고 싶었어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE4C728AC70B2C80020C528AC000020C5BCB9C8B0980020AC15D55CC9C0000AC9C1C8110020BCF4ACE00020C2F6C5C8C5B4C694002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "삐햐햐!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C090D590D59000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "곤율거니! 늘 도움만 받던 제가\n이번에는 당신을 빛나게 할 차례예요!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE4C728AC70B2C800210020B2980020B3C4C6C0B9CC0020BC1BB3580020C81CAC00000AC774BC88C5D0B2940020B2F9C2E0C7440020BE5BB098AC8C0020D5600020CC28B840C608C69400210021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 굉장하시네요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그렇지만, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨와\n진검승부를 겨룬 저 자신도 자랑스러웠어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020AD49C7A5D558C2DCB124C694002100100001BE01000AADF8B807C9C0B9CC002C002000100002010000000020C528C640000AC9C4AC80C2B9BD80B97C0020ACA8B8EC0020C8000020C790C2E0B3C40020C790B791C2A4B7ECC6E0C5B4C694002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨도 이노 씨도\n두 분 다 굉장했어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020C528B3C40020C774B1780020C528B3C4000AB4500020BD840020B2E40020AD49C7A5D588C5B4C694002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 정도로 굉장하신데 어째서\n집에 돌아가는 걸 주저하시는 거죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C815B3C4B85C0020AD49C7A5D558C2E0B3700020C5B4C9F8C11C000AC9D1C5D00020B3CCC544AC00B2940020AC780020C8FCC800D558C2DCB2940020AC70C8E0003F00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여동생을 만나고는 싶지만,\n할머니와 마주치고 싶지 않아서요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECB3D9C0DDC7440020B9CCB098ACE0B2940020C2F6C9C0B9CC002C000AD560BA38B2C8C6400020B9C8C8FCCE58ACE00020C2F6C9C00020C54AC544C11CC694002E002E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "죄송해요! 안샤 씨는 어머니와\n떨어져서 지내시는데... 제가 무신경했어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C8C4C1A1D574C69400210020C548C0E40020C528B2940020C5B4BA38B2C8C640000AB5A8C5B4C838C11C0020C9C0B0B4C2DCB294B370002E002E002E0020C81CAC000020BB34C2E0ACBDD588C5B4C694002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "할머니를 만나고 싶지 않으시다면\n만나지 않아도 된다고 생각해요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D560BA38B2C8B97C0020B9CCB098ACE00020C2F6C9C00020C54AC73CC2DCB2E4BA74000AB9CCB098C9C00020C54AC544B3C40020B41CB2E4ACE00020C0DDAC01D574C694002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네에!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124C5D00021003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아, 그게, 예상 못했던 반응이라 그만...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544002C0020ADF8AC8C002C0020C608C0C10020BABBD588B3580020BC18C751C774B77C0020ADF8B9CC002E002E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하기 싫은 일을 억지로 할 시간에\n자신을 갈고닦는 게 더 낫다고 생각해요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558AE300020C2EBC7400020C77CC7440020C5B5C9C0B85C0020D5600020C2DCAC04C5D0000AC790C2E0C7440020AC08ACE0B2E6B2940020AC8C0020B3540020B0ABB2E4ACE00020C0DDAC01D574C694002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 결과, 상대에게 인정을 받으면 좋은 거고\n그렇지 못해도 손해 보는 건 없으니까요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF80020ACB0ACFC002C0020C0C1B300C5D0AC8C0020C778C815C7440020BC1BC73CBA740020C88BC7400020AC70ACE0000AADF8B807C9C00020BABBD574B3C40020C190D5740020BCF4B2940020AC740020C5C6C73CB2C8AE4CC694002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "거니.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC70B2C8002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "곤율거니도\n안샤 씨의 의견에 찬성인 모양이네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE4C728AC70B2C8B3C4000AC548C0E40020C528C7580020C758ACACC5D00020CC2CC131C7780020BAA8C591C774B124C694002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우선은 동생을 더 많이 기쁘게 만들겠어요.\n할머니는 동생을 끔찍이 아끼시니까요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
